          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントは回答を待っています。先に回答してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Agent is waiting on its question on screen, so nothing was sent. Answer it with the tools keyboard first, then send again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントは画面上の質問を待っているため、送信されませんでした。まずツールキーボードで回答し、再送信してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Agent is waiting on something Heeler can't read. Answer with these keys or in the terminal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントは Heeler が読み取れないものを待っています。これらのキーまたはターミナルで回答してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Agent isn't taking messages: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントはメッセージを受け付けていません: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Agent left the terminal before the message was submitted, so nothing was submitted, and the text is no longer in the terminal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
