            "value": "この画像はプレビューには大きすぎます（最大 20 MB）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is Heeler's row. Sync from plugin keeps it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これは Heeler 専用の行です。「プラグインから同期」でも保持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is no longer the same linked worktree. Nothing was removed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これはもう同じリンク済みワークツリーではありません。何も削除されませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This layout could not be saved. Use at most 3 rows and 16 fields per row, with valid field names.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
